      "content": "Handle session-policy coverage rejection instead of throwing here. `MarketData.resolveDay` returns `Rejected` with code `SessionPolicyCoverage` when `latestCompleted(asOf)` is outside coverage, so both Open browse and Open detail currently reject their promises in that case. P8 requires current figures to be `Unavailable(SessionPolicyNotCovered)` while the rest of the view remains readable. Map that rejection to explicit unavailable figures and add uncovered-clock tests for both APIs; do not invent a session date or reuse an earlier mark.",
